{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27618","headline":"和杜牧之齐山登高 · 张祜","name":"和杜牧之齐山登高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋溪南岸菊霏霏，急管烦弦对落晖。\n红叶树深山径断，碧云江静浦帆稀。\n不堪孙盛嘲时笑，愿送王弘醉夜归。\n流落正怜芳意在，砧声徒促授寒衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27618.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27618","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}